"Vessel" means every description of water craft, including small craft vessel under oars or sail, floating, equipment and
non-displacement craft;
(m)
"Restricted visibility" means any condition in which visibility is restricted by fog, mist, heavy rainstorms, sandstorms or
any other similar causes;
(n)
"Rules" means rules of the road;
(o)
Words used but not defined shall have the same meanings respectively assigned to them in the Act.
